🔹 STEP 3: Semantic HTML (Google Loves This)

❌ Bad:

<div>Title</div>


✅ Good:

<h1>Best Interior Design Company</h1>
<section>
  <article>


Rules:

Only one <h1> per page

Use <header> <main> <footer>

