🔹 STEP 4: Image Optimization (Big Performance Boost)
❌ Wrong
<img src="/banner.jpg" />

✅ Correct
import Image from "next/image";

<Image
  src="/banner.jpg"
  alt="Luxury interior design"
  width={1200}
  height={600}
  priority
/>


✔️ Lazy loading
✔️ Auto resize
✔️ Better LCP score

